{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14827","headline":"詶人失题 · 卢纶","name":"詶人失题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤鸾将鹤羣，晴日丽春云。\n何幸晚飞者，清音长此闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}